IMPORT `pvi-health-assessment`

-- Tests of PART IV (PHẦN IV. LOẠI TRỪ BẢO HIỂM): for every item, a fact pattern that triggers it
-- and a near miss that does not, where the item has a proviso the near miss is the proviso.
-- Each test asserts the WHOLE list of items the claim engages, so a fact pattern that
-- accidentally triggers a second item fails. Expected values are the item numbers the source
-- prints; none was copied from an evaluation. This file is GENERATED by a script from a table of
-- (item, fact pattern, expected items); the source lines are quoted mechanically above each item.

